      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on meta + google performance ads for clinics for dermatology + skincare clinics in Nashik, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code), local landmarks (College Road + Gangapur Road + Panchavati + Indira Nagar), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
