    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Meta + Google performance ads for a dermatology clinic in Nashik, Maharashtra drive 40-60% of new-patient acquisition when executed compliance-safe. Meta (Facebook + Instagram) for discovery + retargeting + Reels amplification; Google Search + Google Ads for high-intent booking queries; Google Business Profile posts + local ads for map-pack booking. This FAQ answers 12 questions Nashik dermatologists ask about paid ads.</p>
